+//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Compute a 16-bit crc over the input data.
+// Inputs:
+//   data - string containing the data
+//   crc - unsigned integer containing the initial crc
+//   table - string containing the 16-bit table corresponding to the generator
+//           polynomial.
