+                    # 1. [FRESH] Return the cache entry w/o doing a GET
+                    # 2. [STALE] Do the GET (but add in cache validators if available)
+                    # 3. [TRANSPARENT] Do a GET w/o any cache validators (Cache-Control: no-cache) on the request
